                    titleFallback: 'Ronda 2 — Negociación con el Ministerio',
                    descKey: 'round2_desc',
                    descFallback: '<b>Negociación directa con el Ministerio de Ambiente sobre las restricciones en La Calera.</b><br><br>Expediciones Montaña tiene 16 años sin incidentes ambientales. Puede argumentar: (1) track record impecable, (2) estándares superiores al promedio, (3) impacto económico en comunidades locales (32 empleos, posadas comunitarias), (4) propuesta de alianza científica para monitoreo ambiental.<br><br><b>Qué busca el Ministerio:</b> después de que el incidente de Gorgona saliera en la prensa, debe mostrar que protege los parques, y ya anunció una auditoría a todos los operadores de parques.<br><b>Qué busca Expediciones:</b> recuperar capacidad de grupos en La Calera. Cada medio grupo diario adicional vale cerca de COP 1,728M de ingresos al año.<br><b>La ecotasa:</b> un pago voluntario anual al fondo de restauración del parque, que sale de la caja mientras los costos trimestrales siguen superando a los ingresos.<br><b>La auditoría:</b> llega el próximo trimestre, y entre lo que encontrará está el campamento de octubre de 2025 fuera de la zona permitida, reportado solo por teléfono. Cómo lo lea el Ministerio dependerá, entre otras cosas, de la relación que deje esta negociación.<br><br>Elija su enfoque de negociación y su oferta de ecotasa.',
                    panel: 2
                },
                {
                    titleKey: 'round3_title',
                    titleFallback: 'Ronda 3 — Auditoría Ambiental Sorpresa',
                    descKey: 'round3_desc',
                    descFallback: '<b>El equipo auditor del Ministerio llega con tres hallazgos:</b><br><br><b>Hallazgo Menor:</b> Registros de residuos incompletos. Solución: 2 semanas de documentación. Sin penalidad directa.<br><br><b>Hallazgo Moderado:</b> Un guía sin certificación de Primeros Auxilios Ambiental. Multa potencial: COP 5M. Plazo: 30 días para corrección.<br><br><b>Hallazgo Mayor:</b> En octubre 2025, un grupo acampó fuera de zona permitida. Expediciones lo reportó verbalmente, pero no hay evidencia escrita. Si el Ministerio lo interpreta como ocultamiento, puede revocar la concesión.<br><br><b>Lo que pesa en cada opción:</b> sin constancia escrita, el Ministerio lee el hallazgo mayor a la luz de la relación que dejó la negociación y de la respuesta de la empresa, y lo que puede retirar es el acceso a La Calera ganado en la ronda 2. El presupuesto de remediación paga la documentación, la certificación y las correcciones que piden los hallazgos; un hallazgo sin ellas queda abierto después de su plazo, con su multa, y el dinero por encima de lo que piden los hallazgos no aporta nada.<br><br>Elija su estrategia de respuesta y asigne presupuesto para remediación.',
                    panel: 3
                },
                {
                    titleKey: 'round4_title',
                    titleFallback: 'Ronda 4 — Plan Estratégico de Sostenibilidad',
                    descKey: 'round4_desc',
                    descFallback: '<b>Presentación al Board: Plan de supervivencia y crecimiento post-crisis.</b><br><br>Debe definir:<br>• <b>Supervivencia 2026–2027:</b> Cómo alcanzar EBITDA positivo en 18 meses<br>• <b>Crecimiento 2027–2029:</b> Escalar operación, mejorar marca vs. Viator/Adventure Brasil, inversión digital<br>• <b>Sostenibilidad:</b> El nivel de compromiso ambiental que asumirá la operación, en un mercado donde los turistas globales pagan premium por experiencias sustentables<br><br>La junta directiva evaluará el año por la caja final, el puntaje ambiental y la reputación. La caja cuenta completa si cubre un año de la brecha trimestral con que empezó el año (4 × COP 436M = COP 1,744M), y en proporción por debajo de esa cifra. Cada opción tiene su precio: crecer más rápido suma ingresos y costos, crecer con socios trae clientes que reservan a través del socio, que se queda con su parte del margen como los intermediarios, y cada escalón de sostenibilidad cuesta más por trimestre. Los ingresos siguen limitados por los guías activos (unos COP 72M por guía al trimestre). La junta solo pagará la excelencia ambiental con lo que genere la operación: mientras los costos trimestrales sigan superando a los ingresos, recorta el programa al cumplimiento mínimo, y solo lo financia completo cuando el EBITDA trimestral cubre su costo adicional.',
                    panel: 4
                }
            ];
        }

        initialize(state) {
            if (!state.domainState || Object.keys(state.domainState).length === 0) {
                state.domainState = {
                    cash: 2000,
                    quarterlyRevenue: 864,
                    quarterlyCosts: 1300,
                    ebitda: -436,
                    guides: 24,
                    certifiedGuides: 8,
                    envScore: 70,
                    reputation: 75,
                    laCaleraCap: 0.4,
                    compliancePaid: 0,
                    negotiationResult: 0,
                    ministryTrust: 1,
                    auditPenalty: 0,
                    cashHistory: [],
                    ebitdaHistory: [],
                    envHistory: [],
                    repHistory: []
                };
            }
            if (!state.decisions || Object.keys(state.decisions).length === 0) {
                // remediation starts at 0, the same as the view: nothing is budgeted before the audit arrives, and the
                // case base of 20, what the three findings need, is the answer round 3 asks for (2026-10-08)
                state.decisions = {
                    strategy: 'expansion',
                    investment: 150,
                    negotiation: 'collaborative',
                    ecoTax: 25,
                    auditResponse: 'full_acceptance',
                    remediation: 0,
                    growthStrategy: 'organic',
                    sustainLevel: 'standard'
                };
            }
            this._updateBriefing(state);
        }

        validateDecisions(decisions) {
            var period = window.mySimulation.state.currentPeriod || 1;

            if (period === 1) {
                var stratEl = document.getElementById('strategySelect');
                if (stratEl) decisions.strategy = stratEl.value;
                var invEl = document.getElementById('investmentInput');
                if (invEl) decisions.investment = parseFloat(invEl.value) || 0;
                if (decisions.investment < 0 || decisions.investment > 500) {
                    window.mySimulation.uiManager.showNotification(
                        window.mySimulation.t('investment_warning'), 'warning'
                    );
                    return false;
                }
            } else if (period === 2) {
                var negEl = document.getElementById('negotiationSelect');
                if (negEl) decisions.negotiation = negEl.value;
                var taxEl = document.getElementById('ecoTaxInput');
                if (taxEl) decisions.ecoTax = parseFloat(taxEl.value) || 0;
                if (decisions.ecoTax < 0 || decisions.ecoTax > 100) {
                    window.mySimulation.uiManager.showNotification(
                        window.mySimulation.t('ecotax_warning'), 'warning'
                    );
                    return false;
                }
            } else if (period === 3) {
                var audEl = document.getElementById('auditSelect');
                if (audEl) decisions.auditResponse = audEl.value;
                var remEl = document.getElementById('remediationInput');
                if (remEl) decisions.remediation = parseFloat(remEl.value) || 0;
                if (decisions.remediation < 0 || decisions.remediation > 60) {
                    window.mySimulation.uiManager.showNotification(
                        window.mySimulation.t('remediation_warning'), 'warning'
                    );
                    return false;
                }
            } else if (period === 4) {
                var grEl = document.getElementById('growthSelect');
                if (grEl) decisions.growthStrategy = grEl.value;
                var susEl = document.getElementById('sustainSelect');
                if (susEl) decisions.sustainLevel = susEl.value;
            }

            this._updateBriefing(window.mySimulation.state);
            return true;
        }

        calculateResults(state) {
            var d = state.decisions;
            var ds = state.domainState;
            var period = state.currentPeriod;
            var revenue = ds.quarterlyRevenue;
            var costs = ds.quarterlyCosts;
            var envDelta = 0;
            var repDelta = 0;
            var guidesLost = 0;
            var narrative = '';
            var sustainFunded = null;
            var oneOffCosts = 0;
            var accessWithdrawn = 0;
            var findingsOpen = 0;
            var relationStrained = false;
            var partnerCapped = false;

            if (period === 1) {
                var inv = Math.min(d.investment, ds.cash * 0.5);
                if (d.strategy === 'cost_reduction') {
                    guidesLost = Math.round(inv / 35);
                    costs = costs - (guidesLost * AVENTURA_SAVING_PER_GUIDE);
                    revenue = revenue * 0.95;
                    repDelta = -5;
                    envDelta = 2;
                    narrative = window.mySimulation.t('r1_cost') || 'Se redujo estructura de costos. Se perdieron guías experimentados.';
                } else if (d.strategy === 'expansion') {
                    var planned = Math.min(inv, AVENTURA_EXPANSION_BASE);
                    revenue = revenue + (planned * 1.2) + ((inv - planned) * 0.6);
                    costs = costs + (inv * 0.6);
                    envDelta = 5;
                    repDelta = 3;
                    narrative = window.mySimulation.t('r1_expansion') || 'Se abrieron rutas en nuevos parques nacionales.';
                } else if (d.strategy === 'urban_pivot') {
                    revenue = revenue + (inv * 0.8);
                    costs = costs + (inv * 0.5);
                    envDelta = -2;
                    repDelta = -3;
                    narrative = window.mySimulation.t('r1_urban') || 'Se lanzaron experiencias de aventura urbana en Medellín y Bogotá.';
                } else if (d.strategy === 'partnership') {
                    var plannedP = Math.min(inv, AVENTURA_EXPANSION_BASE);
                    var partnerRevenue = AVENTURA_PARTNER_REVENUE_PER_PESO * (plannedP + 0.5 * (inv - plannedP));
                    revenue = revenue + partnerRevenue;
                    costs = costs + partnerRevenue * AVENTURA_PARTNER_COST_RATIO;
                    repDelta = -8;
                    envDelta = 3;
                    narrative = window.mySimulation.t('r1_partner') || 'Se negoció alianza con operador internacional. Se pierde independencia parcial.';
                }
                costs = costs + 31;
                ds.compliancePaid = 124;
                ds.cash = ds.cash - inv;
            } else if (period === 2) {
                var capGain = 0;
                var taxCost = d.ecoTax / 4;
                // Environmental and reputation steps are sized so that a year of good decisions takes the scores from
                // 70 and 75 to the low or mid 90s without reaching 100 before the last round (2026-10-08): at the old
                // sizes the case path hit 100 in round 3, and from there no later decision could move them.
                var ecoEnv = aventuraEcoTaxEnv(d.ecoTax);
                if (d.negotiation === 'collaborative') {
                    capGain = 0.225;
                    envDelta = 5 + ecoEnv;
                    repDelta = 4;
                    ds.ministryTrust = 1;
                    narrative = window.mySimulation.t('r2_collab') || 'Negociación colaborativa exitosa. Se obtuvieron 1.5 grupos/día en La Calera.';
                } else if (d.negotiation === 'aggressive') {
                    capGain = 0.3;
                    envDelta = 1;
                    repDelta = -4;
                    ds.ministryTrust = 0;
                    relationStrained = true;
                    narrative = window.mySimulation.t('r2_aggr') || 'Se presionó al Ministerio. Se obtuvieron 2 grupos/día pero la relación quedó tensa.';
                } else {
                    capGain = 0.15;
                    envDelta = 3 + ecoEnv;
                    repDelta = 2;
                    ds.ministryTrust = 1;
                    narrative = window.mySimulation.t('r2_conc') || 'Enfoque concesivo. Mejora modesta en acceso, buena relación con Ministerio.';
                }
                ds.laCaleraCap = Math.min(ds.laCaleraCap + capGain, 1.0);
                var laCalRevenueGain = capGain * 1728;
                revenue = revenue + laCalRevenueGain;
                costs = costs + taxCost;
                ds.negotiationResult = capGain;
            } else if (period === 3) {
                var fine = 0;
                var remCost = Math.max(0, Math.min(60, d.remediation || 0));
                var closed = Math.min(1, remCost / AVENTURA_REMEDIATION_NEED);
                var withdrawShare = 0;
                if (d.auditResponse === 'full_acceptance') {
                    fine = 8;
                    envDelta = 2 + 5 * closed;
                    repDelta = 5;
                    withdrawShare = AVENTURA_ACCESS_WITHDRAWN.full_acceptance;
                    narrative = window.mySimulation.t('r3_accept') || 'Aceptación responsable. Ministerio valora transparencia. Concesión asegurada.';
                } else if (d.auditResponse === 'partial_contest') {
                    fine = 5;
                    envDelta = 1 + 3 * closed;
                    repDelta = -3;
                    withdrawShare = AVENTURA_ACCESS_WITHDRAWN.partial_contest;
                    narrative = window.mySimulation.t('r3_partial') || 'Se contestó hallazgo mayor. Resultado mixto: multa reducida, relación deteriorada.';
                } else {
                    fine = 2;
                    envDelta = -6 + 2 * closed;
                    repDelta = -10;
                    withdrawShare = AVENTURA_ACCESS_WITHDRAWN.full_contest;
                    narrative = window.mySimulation.t('r3_contest') || 'Se contestaron todos los hallazgos. Ministerio considera falta de cooperación. Riesgo elevado.';
                }
                // findings the budget does not cover stay open: the fine for the guide applies and reputation pays
                findingsOpen = 1 - closed;
                fine = fine + 5 * findingsOpen;
                repDelta = repDelta - 5 * findingsOpen;
                // the Ministry takes back part of the round 2 access, more when the relationship was left strained
                if (ds.ministryTrust === 0) withdrawShare = withdrawShare + AVENTURA_ACCESS_WITHDRAWN.strained;
                withdrawShare = Math.min(1, withdrawShare);
                var gainR2 = ds.negotiationResult || 0;
                accessWithdrawn = withdrawShare * gainR2 * 1728;
                revenue = revenue - accessWithdrawn;
                ds.laCaleraCap = Math.max(0, ds.laCaleraCap - withdrawShare * gainR2);
                // the fine and the remediation budget are paid once, in this quarter, not every quarter after it
                oneOffCosts = fine + remCost;
                costs = costs + oneOffCosts;
                ds.auditPenalty = fine;
            } else if (period === 4) {
                if (d.growthStrategy === 'organic') {
                    revenue = revenue * 1.15;
                    costs = costs * 1.05;
                    repDelta = 3;
                } else if (d.growthStrategy === 'aggressive_growth') {
                    revenue = revenue * 1.35;
                    costs = costs * 1.2;
                    repDelta = -2;
                } else {
                    // Partnerships to scale: the extra clients book through the partner, which keeps its share as
                    // intermediaries do (case: bookings through intermediaries leave less margin, and the alliance
                    // brings clients in exchange for part of the independence of the company). Like the round 1
                    // alliance they earn the 2025 margin, on the clients the active guides can lead, and they are the
                    // clients of the partner, so less of the growth shows in the reviews of the company.
                    var capacityR4 = Math.max(6, ds.guides) * AVENTURA_REVENUE_PER_GUIDE;
                    var grownR4 = Math.min(revenue * 1.25, capacityR4);
                    partnerCapped = revenue * 1.25 > capacityR4;
                    costs = costs + Math.max(0, grownR4 - revenue) * AVENTURA_PARTNER_COST_RATIO;
                    revenue = grownR4;
                    repDelta = 1;
                }

                if (d.sustainLevel === 'minimum') {
                    envDelta = 1;
                    costs = costs + 10;
                } else if (d.sustainLevel === 'standard') {
                    envDelta = 5;
                    costs = costs + 40;
                    repDelta = repDelta + 3;
                } else {
                    // Excellence is paid out of what the operation earns, not out of the cash reserve: the board
                    // funds the share of its extra 70M a quarter over minimum compliance that last quarter EBITDA
                    // covers. While costs still exceed revenue it is cut back to minimum compliance (case: costs
                    // of 1,300 against revenue of 864, cash for little more than a year, the CFO wants cuts now).
                    // Kept with the graded cash score: its extra 40 a quarter over standard costs well under one
                    // point of cash, less than the 5 env and 3 rep it adds over standard, so cash alone would not
                    // stop excellence from winning on almost every path.
                    var funded = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, (ds.ebitda || 0) / 70));
                    envDelta = 1 + 9 * funded;
                    costs = costs + 10 + 70 * funded;
                    repDelta = repDelta + 6 * funded;
                    sustainFunded = funded;
                }
                narrative = window.mySimulation.t('r4_result') || 'Plan estratégico presentado al Board.';
            }

            // the guides left after this quarter set the most revenue the quarter can bring in
            var guidesNow = Math.max(6, ds.guides - guidesLost);
            var guideCapacity = guidesNow * AVENTURA_REVENUE_PER_GUIDE;
            var guideCapped = revenue > guideCapacity;
            if (guideCapped) revenue = guideCapacity;
            if (partnerCapped) guideCapped = true;

            revenue = Math.round(revenue);
            costs = Math.round(costs);
            var ebitda = revenue - costs;
            ds.quarterlyRevenue = revenue;
            ds.quarterlyCosts = Math.round(costs - oneOffCosts);
            ds.ebitda = ebitda;
            ds.cash = Math.round(ds.cash + ebitda);
            ds.guides = guidesNow;
            ds.envScore = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, ds.envScore + envDelta));
            ds.reputation = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, ds.reputation + repDelta));

            ds.cashHistory.push(ds.cash);
            ds.ebitdaHistory.push(ebitda);
            ds.envHistory.push(ds.envScore);
            ds.repHistory.push(ds.reputation);

            // platform score: same composite as getPerformanceSummary, graded cash (up to 25, see aventuraCashPoints) plus env times 0.4 plus reputation times 0.35, already 0 to 100
            var compositeVal = Math.round(aventuraCashPoints(ds.cash) + (ds.envScore * 0.4) + (ds.reputation * 0.35));
            var overallScoreVal = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, compositeVal));
            state.domainState.performance = Object.assign({}, state.domainState.performance || {}, { overallScore: overallScoreVal });

            var self = this;
            setTimeout(((__eqilNext) => function() {
                self._updateBriefing({ currentPeriod: __eqilNext });
            })(state.currentPeriod + 1), 500);

            if (state.currentPeriod >= (state.maxPeriods || this.ROUNDS.length)) { var selfC = this; setTimeout(function() { try { selfC._renderCompletion(state); } catch (e) {} }, 0); }

            return {
                period: period,
                revenue: revenue,
                costs: costs,
                ebitda: ebitda,
                cash: ds.cash,
                guides: ds.guides,
                envScore: ds.envScore,
                reputation: ds.reputation,
                sustainFunded: sustainFunded,
                guideCapped: guideCapped,
                relationStrained: relationStrained,
                accessWithdrawn: Math.round(accessWithdrawn),
                findingsOpen: findingsOpen,
                narrative: narrative
            };
        }

        setupUI(uiManager) {
            uiManager.bind('currentDay', 'currentPeriod');
            uiManager.bind('maxPeriods', 'maxPeriods');
            uiManager.bind('cashDisplay', 'domainState.cash',
                (v) => 'COP ' + Math.round(v).toLocaleString() + 'M');
            uiManager.bind('revenueDisplay', 'domainState.quarterlyRevenue',
                (v) => 'COP ' + Math.round(v).toLocaleString() + 'M');
            uiManager.bind('ebitdaDisplay', 'domainState.ebitda',
                (v) => 'COP ' + Math.round(v).toLocaleString() + 'M');
            uiManager.bind('guidesDisplay', 'domainState.guides');
            uiManager.bind('envDisplay', 'domainState.envScore',
                (v) => Math.round(v) + '/100');
            uiManager.bind('reputationDisplay', 'domainState.reputation',
                (v) => Math.round(v) + '/100');
        }

